(18) Antara News (2024). National per capita health spending IDR 2.2 million/year (2023). Cross-referencing BPS Health Statistics Profile 2023 publication: https://www.bps.go.id/en/publication/2023/12/20/feffe5519c812d560bb131ca/health-statistics-profile-2023.html [NEEDS-ATTENDED-FETCH: returned HTTP 403]

